  "notes": [
    "Functions 03 (read) and 06 (write one register). Values are 32-bit integers in two registers without decimal point; the word order is not stated, high word first is assumed.",
    "Set on the indicator (menu PORT 1): Id = slave number 1 to 98, R1 = 3 (PLC), B1 = 3 (9600 baud), H1 = 0, F1 = 0 for Modbus RTU 8N1 or 1 for ASCII 7 bits, 2 stop bits.",
    "RS-232 by default; RS-485 and RS-422 are optional.",
    "Written from the manufacturer's manual (Spanish); not tested on a device."
  ],
